---
// BMS 專屬視覺化 section
---

<div class="space-y-24">

  <!-- 整合架構 -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <p class="readout text-brand-2">INTEGRATION ARCHITECTURE</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-tx">一個平台，整合全棟子系統</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-tx-muted">
        BMS 作為大樓智慧神經中樞，將原本各自為政的子系統統一收斂到單一監控平台。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-bg p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-3 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand/10">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-tx">機電系統</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-tx-muted">電力、空調、照明、電梯設備狀態即時監控</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-bg p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-3 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-alert/10">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-alert" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 18.657A8 8 0 016.343 7.343S7 9 9 10c0-2 .5-5 2.986-7C14 5 16.09 5.777 17.656 7.343A7.975 7.975 0 0120 13a7.975 7.975 0 01-2.343 5.657z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-tx">消防系統</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-tx-muted">煙霧偵測、灑水、緊急廣播整合預警</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-bg p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-3 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand/10">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 7a2 2 0 012 2m4 0a6 6 0 01-7.743 5.743L11 17H9v2H7v2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-2.586a1 1 0 01.293-.707l5.964-5.964A6 6 0 1121 9z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-tx">門禁安防</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-tx-muted">門禁控制、CCTV、訪客管理一體化</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-bg p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-3 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand/10">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-tx">環境感測</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-tx-muted">溫濕度、CO₂、PM2.5 等環境品質監測</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 從被動到主動 -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <p class="readout text-brand-2">RISK MANAGEMENT</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-tx">從「被動滅火」到「主動防災」</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-tx-muted">
        BMS 重新定義大樓管理的工作方式，讓管理者提前掌握風險。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-alert/30 bg-bg p-8">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-alert/10 px-3 py-1.5">
          <span class="readout text-alert">導入前</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-alert/20 text-xs text-alert">✕</span>
            <span class="text-tx-muted">各系統獨立儀表板，值班人員要盯多個螢幕</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-alert/20 text-xs text-alert">✕</span>
            <span class="text-tx-muted">異常只在事故發生後才被發現，無法事前預警</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-alert/20 text-xs text-alert">✕</span>
            <span class="text-tx-muted">緊急應變靠人工判斷，缺乏即時現場資訊支援</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-alert/20 text-xs text-alert">✕</span>
            <span class="text-tx-muted">事後報告耗時費力，難以追溯事件完整脈絡</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-brand bg-ink p-8">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-brand px-3 py-1.5">
          <span class="readout text-white">導入後</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand/30 text-xs text-brand">✓</span>
            <span class="text-tx-invert-muted">單一 3D 視覺化介面，全棟狀態一目了然</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand/30 text-xs text-brand">✓</span>
            <span class="text-tx-invert-muted">風險分級主動預警，消防從滅火推進到預防</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand/30 text-xs text-brand">✓</span>
            <span class="text-tx-invert-muted">事件自動彙整周邊點位與處置建議，秒級決策</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand/30 text-xs text-brand">✓</span>
            <span class="text-tx-invert-muted">完整事件日誌自動生成，合規稽核輕鬆達成</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 適用場景 -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <p class="readout text-brand-2">DEPLOYMENT SCENARIOS</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-tx">三大核心應用場景</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-bg p-7 shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand/10">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-2 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-tx">政府機關與公部門</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-tx-muted">辦公大樓安全管理、合規稽核、能源用量管控，符合政府採購與資安規範。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-bg p-7 shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand/10">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 12h14M5 12a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v4a2 2 0 01-2 2M5 12a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2m-2-4h.01M17 16h.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-tx">資料中心與機房</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-tx-muted">整合機房機電、消防、環境與門禁，與 CortexDC 無縫銜接，形成從大樓到機架的完整視野。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-bg p-7 shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand/10">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-brand" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-tx">大型商辦與綜合建築</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-tx-muted">多租戶管理、跨樓層監控、物業與設施管理整合，提升管理效率與租戶滿意度。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
